synthetic login.defs parser verdict fixtures
unrelated-keys-any-shape: a valueless key and a multi-word value on keys this reader does not consume (shadow reads both); accepted
required-key-without-value: a range key with no value; refused, never defaulted
nbsp-separated-required-key: SYS_GID_MIN joined to its value by U+00A0, which shadow's ASCII isspace does not split, so shadow sees no SYS_GID_MIN; refused as absent
